tore":"DigiKey","url":"https://www.digikey.com/en/products/result?keywords=HPM5361ICB1"},{"store":"Mouser","url":"https://www.mouser.com/c/?q=HPM5361ICB1"},{"store":"JLCPCB parts","url":"https://jlcpcb.com/parts/componentSearch?searchTxt=C49374595"},{"store":"Octopart","url":"https://octopart.com/search?q=HPM5361ICB1"}]}],"released":2023,"status":"active","datasheetUrl":"https://www.hpmicro.com/Public/Uploads/uploadfile/files/20250205/HPM5300DSV011.pdf","productUrl":"https://www.hpmicro.com/en/product-center/microcontroller/hpm5300","notes":["CAN: 4x Bosch M_CAN (MCAN) controllers, all CAN-FD (up to 8 Mbit/s), plus 4x LIN. All four CAN ports can be pinned out even on the QFN-48. HPM5321 has the same CAN/UART set without the motor-control blocks; HPM5331/HPM5301 have no CAN.","USB 2.0 High-Speed OTG with integrated HS PHY. On LQFP-64/QFN-48 USB_DP/DM share pins PA24/PA25 (set them to analog mode for USB).","The 1 MB flash is in-package (stacked serial NOR on XPI0) and is the boot device. XPI0 port-A pins are also brought out (datasheet lists Quad SPI NOR/PSRAM/HyperRAM support), but external flash/PSRAM is not counted here.","ROM ISP: UART0 on every package, but USB ISP only on the LQFP-100 (LQFP-64/QFN-48 boot ROM is UART0-only). Boot mode set by pins PA02/PA03. Debug is JTAG.","No SD/SDIO host, Ethernet or I2S: use SPI for microSD.","QFN-48 drops UART4/UART5 and SPI3 (7 UART, 3 SPI); LQFP-64 drops UART4/UART5.","Single 3.0-3.6 V supply; on-chip DCDC (needs an inductor) makes the 1.1-1.3 V core rail. IO banks run at 3.3 V or 1.8 V.","No battery-backed RTC or 32.768 kHz crystal input (only an internal 32 kHz RC). Shutdown current is about 2.3 uA, but SRAM is not retained.","Power: about 33.5 mA from 3.3 V at 480 MHz running CoreMark from ILM with peripherals off (about 60 mA with all peripherals on).","Software: HPM SDK (GCC/CMake, free SEGGER Embedded Studio) and RT-Thread BSPs. Not in upstream Zephyr (HPMicro maintains its own fork). The hpm-hal Rust crate (embassy) exists but is marked work-in-progress."],"sources":["https://www.hpmicro.com/Public/Uploads/uploadfile/files/20250205/HPM5300DSV011.pdf","https://www.hpmicro.com/en/product-center/microcontroller/hpm5300","https://www.lcsc.com/product-detail/C49451871.html","https://www.lcsc.com/product-detail/C49451870.html","https://www.lcsc.com/product-detail/C49374595.html","https://github.com/hpmicro/hpm-hal","https://github.com/zephyrproject-rtos/zephyr/tree/main/soc"],"boards":["hpm5300evk"]}